            ""id"": ""k_o_eat"",
            ""text"": ""Eat first. Talk after."",
            ""to"": ""k_pitch""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_now"",
            ""text"": ""Skip the broth. What's the job?"",
            ""to"": ""k_pitch""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_read"",
            ""text"": ""You only feed people you feel guilty about."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""intelligence"": 6
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""k_read""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_leave"",
            ""text"": ""Not tonight, Kaz."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_read"": {
        ""text"": ""Hnh. Nine years and you finally learn to read a face.\nFine. Yes. Guilty. The last runner I sent on this is in a drawer at the county morgue with no eyes, and I'm still going to ask you."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""kaz_honest"",
            ""value"": true
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_read_ask"",
            ""text"": ""Then ask."",
            ""to"": ""k_pitch""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_pitch"": {
        ""text"": ""Courier came through the sector four nights ago carrying a shard with no manufacturer mark. Not scrubbed — never had one. He didn't make it to the handoff. He made it to Rain Alley, stuffed it behind a dead vending machine, and then he made it to a wall."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_who"",
            ""text"": ""Who wanted it?"",
            ""to"": ""k_who""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_what"",
            ""text"": ""What's on it?"",
            ""to"": ""k_what""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_tech"",
            ""text"": ""No mark means custom fab. That is a corporate print run."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""technical"": 5
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""k_tech""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_deal"",
            ""text"": ""How much?"",
            ""to"": ""k_money""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_who"": {
        ""text"": ""Three parties have asked me about it this week. One wore a suit. One wore a Sixth Street jacket. The third called on a line that shouldn't exist and didn't have a voice so much as a shape where a voice goes."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_who_back"",
            ""text"": ""Go on."",
            ""to"": ""k_what""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_deal2"",
            ""text"": ""And the pay?"",
            ""to"": ""k_money""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_what"": {
        ""text"": ""I don't know. I make noodles. What I know is it's warm. Shards aren't warm, chombatta. Whatever's on that thing is running."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_what_back"",
            ""text"": ""Running what?"",
            ""to"": ""k_who""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_intuit"",
            ""text"": ""It's not data. It's a process. Someone's on that shard."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""intelligence"": 8
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""k_intuit""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_deal3"",
            ""text"": ""Let's talk numbers."",
            ""to"": ""k_money""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_intuit"": {
        ""text"": ""...\nYou say that out loud in here again and I will put you out in the rain with the bill.\nYes. That is what I think. That is exactly what I think."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""kaz_guessed_wire"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 150
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_intuit_deal"",
            ""text"": ""Then I want paying like it matters."",
            ""to"": ""k_money""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_tech"": {
        ""text"": ""Corporate print run with no corporate mark. Which means either somebody burned a fab line to make one thing, or somebody's fab line made something they never wrote down."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""kaz_tech_read"",
            ""value"": true
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_tech_deal"",
            ""text"": ""Price."",
            ""to"": ""k_money""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_tech_who"",
            ""text"": ""Who came asking?"",
            ""to"": ""k_who""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_money"": {
        ""text"": ""Two thousand on delivery. Before you make that face — the shard is twenty metres of alley away and nobody is guarding it, because everyone guarding it is dead."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_accept"",
            ""text"": ""Two thousand. Fine."",
            ""to"": ""k_accept""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_haggle"",
            ""text"": ""Five. You already lost one runner on this."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""cool"": 7
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""k_haggle""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_cred"",
            ""text"": ""Kaz. Everybody in this sector knows who I am now. Price goes up."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""streetCred"": 3
            },
            ""to"": ""k_haggle""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_walk"",
            ""text"": ""Not for two thousand."",
            ""to"": ""k_walk""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_haggle"": {
        ""text"": ""Four. And I put your tab from March in the fire.\n...Fine. Four five. Stop looking at me like that, you learned it from me."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""kaz_haggled"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addMoney"",
            ""amount"": 500
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_haggle_yes"",
            ""text"": ""Deal."",
            ""to"": ""k_accept""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_walk"": {
        ""text"": ""Then eat your noodles and go home. The offer sits here getting cold, same as everything else in this place."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_walk_back"",
            ""text"": ""On second thought."",
            ""to"": ""k_money""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_walk_out"",
            ""text"": ""See you around, Kaz."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_accept"": {
        ""text"": ""Rain Alley. Panel behind the vending machine that has been OUT OF ORDER since before you had a jaw made of factory parts.\nAnd chombatta — if it talks to you, do not answer."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""kaz_job_taken"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""startQuest"",
            ""questId"": ""q_main_ghost""
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 100
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""notify"",
            ""text"": ""Job accepted — Ghost in the Rain"",
            ""kind"": ""quest""
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_end"",
            ""text"": ""If it talks, I answer."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_already"": {
        ""text"": ""Still here? The alley is that way, the rain is free, and the shard is not getting warmer.\nYou want something else or you want more broth?"",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_stock"",
            ""text"": ""What are you selling tonight?"",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_kaz""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_more"",
            ""text"": ""Tell me about the third caller. The one with no voice."",
            ""condition"": {
              ""flag"": ""kaz_honest""
            },
            ""once"": true,
            ""to"": ""k_third""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_bye"",
            ""text"": ""Just passing."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_third"": {
        ""text"": ""It said please. Twice. Nobody in this sector says please twice.\nIt asked whether the shard was safe. Not where it was. Whether it was safe.\nGo on. Go pull it out of a wall."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""kaz_third_caller"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 80
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_third_end"",
            ""text"": ""Thanks, Kaz."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""k_after"": {
        ""text"": ""You came back. Most of them stop coming back.\nSit. Eat. This one is free, and I do not want to talk about the shard."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_after_stock"",
            ""text"": ""What have you got?"",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_kaz""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""k_o_after_end"",
            ""text"": ""Just the broth, then."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    ""id"": ""dlg_vey"",
    ""title"": ""Doc Vey"",
    ""speaker"": ""DOC VEY"",
    ""location"": ""ripperdoc"",
    ""start"": ""v_open"",
    ""entries"": [
      {
        ""when"": {
          ""quest"": {
            ""id"": ""q_side_chrometax"",
            ""stage"": ""s_return""
          }
        },
        ""node"": ""v_return""
      },
      {
        ""when"": {
          ""flag"": ""vey_burned""
        },
        ""node"": ""v_burned""
      },
      {
        ""when"": {
          ""flag"": ""vey_trusts""
        },
        ""node"": ""v_friend""
      }
    ],
    ""nodes"": {
      ""v_open"": {
        ""text"": ""Chair's wet, mind the puddle — no, that's coolant, it's fine, it's mostly fine.\nCash first. I don't do payment plans, I do funerals for people who ask for payment plans."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_shop"",
            ""text"": ""Show me what you've got in stock."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_vey""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_job"",
            ""text"": ""Kaz says you have a problem."",
            ""to"": ""v_job""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_tech"",
            ""text"": ""Your autoclave is cycling twelve degrees cold."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""technical"": 6
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""v_tech""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_out"",
            ""text"": ""Just looking."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_tech"": {
        ""text"": ""...\nIt is, isn't it. I have been telling myself that hum was the compressor for three weeks.\nYou just saved me a lawsuit and a patient. Ten percent off, permanently, and I will pretend that is generosity instead of terror."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""vey_discount"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 120
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""notify"",
            ""text"": ""Doc Vey's prices reduced"",
            ""kind"": ""good""
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_tech_shop"",
            ""text"": ""Let's see that stock."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_vey""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_tech_job"",
            ""text"": ""Now. Your problem."",
            ""to"": ""v_job""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_job"": {
        ""text"": ""Two crates. Biotechnica perfusion stock, paid for in full, signed for by a driver who is currently drinking my money at the Chrome Cathedral.\nSixth Street took them off the truck at the overpass and put them in the back of that garage like it is a church and they are collecting the plate."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_job_why"",
            ""text"": ""Why not call it in?"",
            ""to"": ""v_why""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_job_pay"",
            ""text"": ""What's it worth?"",
            ""to"": ""v_pay""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_job_muscle"",
            ""text"": ""I can walk in the front. Loudly."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""body"": 8
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""v_muscle""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_why"": {
        ""text"": ""Call who in? NCPD bills by the hour and arrives by the week. Sixth Street is who you call when NCPD does not come. There is no third number."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_why_pay"",
            ""text"": ""So what does it pay?"",
            ""to"": ""v_pay""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_muscle"": {
        ""text"": ""You could. And then I would be fixing you for free out of guilt, and I have run the numbers on that, and it costs me more than the crates.\nDo it quiet if you can. Do it loud if you must. Do it tonight either way."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""vey_expects_loud"",
            ""value"": true
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_muscle_pay"",
            ""text"": ""Pay?"",
            ""to"": ""v_pay""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_pay"": {
        ""text"": ""Two two hundred, or two two hundred in parts at cost, which is worth more and you know it. Take the parts. Everyone takes the eddies and everyone regrets it."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_pay_yes"",
            ""text"": ""I'll get your crates."",
            ""to"": ""v_accept""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_pay_haggle"",
            ""text"": ""Parts AND eddies, Doc. You are not the only ripper on this grid."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""cool"": 6
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""v_haggle""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_pay_no"",
            ""text"": ""Find someone else."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_haggle"": {
        ""text"": ""I am the only ripper on this grid who will work on a spine at 4am without asking whose it is.\n...But yes. Fine. Parts and eddies. You are a menace."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""vey_haggled"",
            ""value"": true
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_haggle_yes"",
            ""text"": ""Pleasure doing business."",
            ""to"": ""v_accept""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_accept"": {
        ""text"": ""Chrome Cathedral. Back room, blue lock, phones home the second you breathe on it. Take the lock apart properly and it never gets to make the call.\nAnd do not open the crates. I will know. The seals are printed with my face on them."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""startQuest"",
            ""questId"": ""q_side_chrometax""
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""vey_job_taken"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""notify"",
            ""text"": ""Job accepted — Chrome Tax"",
            ""kind"": ""quest""
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_accept_end"",
            ""text"": ""Back before morning."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_return"": {
        ""text"": ""You're wet, you're bleeding from somewhere I can't see yet, and you're carrying my crates.\nTwo out of three is a good night. Put them on the bench."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_return_hand"",
            ""text"": ""All yours, Doc."",
            ""to"": ""v_paid""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_return_keep"",
            ""text"": ""About that. I think I am keeping them."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""cool"": 8
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""v_keep""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_return_holo"",
            ""text"": ""Also — Sixth Street had a camera on the whole thing."",
            ""condition"": {
              ""item"": {
                ""q_evidence_holo"": 1
              }
            },
            ""once"": true,
            ""to"": ""v_holo""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_holo"": {
        ""text"": ""Nine seconds of a Sixth Street lieutenant signing for stolen medical stock with his own face.\nThat is not evidence, that is a pension. Give it here. I will pay for it like it is a kidney."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""removeItem"",
            ""templateId"": ""q_evidence_holo"",
            ""qty"": 1
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addMoney"",
            ""amount"": 1500
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 200
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""vey_has_leverage"",
            ""value"": true
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_holo_hand"",
            ""text"": ""Now take your crates."",
            ""to"": ""v_paid""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_keep"": {
        ""text"": ""Say that again slowly so I can decide whether to be frightened or insulted.\n...No, keep them. Walk out. But you are off my chair permanently, and when something in you fails at 4am — and it will — you can go bleed at the Night Market like everybody else."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""chrometax_kept"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""notify"",
            ""text"": ""Doc Vey will not work on you again"",
            ""kind"": ""bad""
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_keep_end"",
            ""text"": ""Understood."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_paid"": {
        ""text"": ""Good. Sit down, shut up, and let me look at that shoulder before you bleed on something expensive.\nThis one is on the house. Do not tell anyone. I have a reputation."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""chrometax_delivered"",
            ""value"": true
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_paid_shop"",
            ""text"": ""Let's see those parts."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_vey""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_paid_end"",
            ""text"": ""Thanks, Doc."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_friend"": {
        ""text"": ""Chair is clean, coffee is not. Sit anywhere.\nYou want steel, or you want to tell me about whatever it is you have been carrying around behind your eyes?"",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_friend_shop"",
            ""text"": ""Steel."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_vey""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_friend_gig"",
            ""text"": ""Got anything that pays and does not involve Sixth Street?"",
            ""to"": ""v_gig""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_friend_end"",
            ""text"": ""Another time."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_gig"": {
        ""text"": ""Perfusion case. Live heart, sealed, four minutes of battery once I arm it. Buyer is standing at the Night Market right now pretending to look at fish.\nYou run it, you run it now, and you do not stop to be a hero on the way."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""startQuest"",
            ""questId"": ""q_gig_cardiac""
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""notify"",
            ""text"": ""Gig accepted — Cardiac Arrest"",
            ""kind"": ""quest""
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_gig_end"",
            ""text"": ""Arm it."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""v_burned"": {
        ""text"": ""Door. Now. I do not care what is hanging out of you."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""v_o_burned_end"",
            ""text"": ""..."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    ""id"": ""dlg_marlene"",
    ""title"": ""Tin Marlene"",
    ""speaker"": ""TIN MARLENE"",
    ""location"": ""pawn"",
    ""start"": ""m_open"",
    ""entries"": [
      {
        ""when"": {
          ""quest"": {
            ""id"": ""q_gig_ledger"",
            ""stage"": ""s_choice""
          }
        },
        ""node"": ""m_ledger_back""
      },
      {
        ""when"": {
          ""flag"": ""marlene_enemy""
        },
        ""node"": ""m_enemy""
      }
    ],
    ""nodes"": {
      ""m_open"": {
        ""text"": ""Everything in the window is priced. Everything behind me is not for sale. Everything under the counter is negotiable and I will decide which is which.\nWhat are you selling?"",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_trade"",
            ""text"": ""Trading."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_marlene""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_work"",
            ""text"": ""Looking for work."",
            ""to"": ""m_work""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_haggle"",
            ""text"": ""Your window prices are forty percent over the market and you know it."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""perk"": ""haggler""
            },
            ""to"": ""m_haggle""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_bye"",
            ""text"": ""Sheltering from the rain."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_haggle"": {
        ""text"": ""Forty-two, actually. The window is for tourists and cops, and I cannot always tell them apart.\nYou get counter prices. Do not tell the window."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""marlene_counter_prices"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""notify"",
            ""text"": ""Tin Marlene offers counter prices"",
            ""kind"": ""good""
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_haggle_trade"",
            ""text"": ""Then let me see the counter."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_marlene""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_haggle_work"",
            ""text"": ""And work?"",
            ""to"": ""m_work""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_work"": {
        ""text"": ""Work. Hm.\nI keep a ledger. Paper. Actual paper, with a pen, like a caveman, because nothing on paper has ever been breached by a fourteen-year-old with a deck.\nThree nights ago a fourteen-year-old with no deck at all walked in and took it."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_work_what"",
            ""text"": ""What's in it?"",
            ""to"": ""m_what""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_work_who"",
            ""text"": ""Who took it?"",
            ""to"": ""m_who""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_work_pay"",
            ""text"": ""What does it pay?"",
            ""to"": ""m_pay""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_what"": {
        ""text"": ""Debts. Names. Which is the same thing in this sector.\nNine of those names would burn this block down to get that book back, and they do not know it is gone, and that is the only reason we are having a quiet conversation instead of a loud one."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_what_who"",
            ""text"": ""So who has it?"",
            ""to"": ""m_who""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_what_read"",
            ""text"": ""You are not scared of the nine. You are scared of one."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""intelligence"": 7
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""m_read""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_what_pay"",
            ""text"": ""Pay."",
            ""to"": ""m_pay""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_read"": {
        ""text"": ""...\nThe eighth name is mine. I owe it to myself, in a manner of speaking, and if the wrong person reads the arithmetic they will work out exactly how this shop got bought.\nThat is the whole of it. Do not make me say more."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""marlene_secret"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 180
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_read_pay"",
            ""text"": ""I'll get your book."",
            ""to"": ""m_pay""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_who"": {
        ""text"": ""Kid sleeps under the Sixth Street overpass. Green coat, three sizes wrong, reflective tape on both sleeves so the cars see her.\nShe is not the problem. Whoever paid her is the problem, and I would like the book back before I have to find out which."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_who_pay"",
            ""text"": ""Terms?"",
            ""to"": ""m_pay""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_pay"": {
        ""text"": ""Three thousand two hundred and a coat off the rack that will stop a knife once. Book comes back closed. That last part is the whole contract."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_pay_yes"",
            ""text"": ""Closed. Understood."",
            ""to"": ""m_accept""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_pay_press"",
            ""text"": ""Book comes back closed. For five."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""cool"": 8
              }
            },
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""addMoney"",
                ""amount"": 800
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""marlene_haggled"",
                ""value"": true
              }
            ],
            ""to"": ""m_accept""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_pay_no"",
            ""text"": ""Not my kind of job."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_accept"": {
        ""text"": ""Overpass. Green coat. Do not frighten her — she has had a worse year than either of us.\nAnd chombatta. Closed."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""startQuest"",
            ""questId"": ""q_gig_ledger""
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""notify"",
            ""text"": ""Gig accepted — Tin Man's Ledger"",
            ""kind"": ""quest""
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_accept_end"",
            ""text"": ""Closed."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_ledger_back"": {
        ""text"": ""You have it. I can see the corner of it and I am going to pretend I cannot, because I would like to hear you say it."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_give"",
            ""text"": ""Here. Closed, like you asked."",
            ""condition"": {
              ""item"": {
                ""q_ledger"": 1
              }
            },
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""removeItem"",
                ""templateId"": ""q_ledger"",
                ""qty"": 1
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""completeObjective"",
                ""questId"": ""q_gig_ledger"",
                ""objectiveId"": ""o_decide""
              }
            ],
            ""to"": ""m_returned""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_blackmail"",
            ""text"": ""I read it. Nine names. I think we should discuss the eighth."",
            ""condition"": {
              ""all"": [
                {
                  ""item"": {
                    ""q_ledger"": 1
                  }
                },
                {
                  ""flag"": ""marlene_secret""
                }
              ]
            },
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""cool"": 9
              }
            },
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""ledger_blackmail"",
                ""value"": true
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""completeObjective"",
                ""questId"": ""q_gig_ledger"",
                ""objectiveId"": ""o_decide""
              }
            ],
            ""to"": ""m_blackmail""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_notyet"",
            ""text"": ""Not yet."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_returned"": {
        ""text"": ""She took it with both hands, like a plate.\n...Thank you. I do not say that in this shop. Take the coat, take the money, and come back when you need something the window does not have."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_returned_shop"",
            ""text"": ""What does the counter have?"",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""openVendor"",
                ""vendorId"": ""v_marlene""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_returned_end"",
            ""text"": ""See you around, Marlene."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_blackmail"": {
        ""text"": ""Of course you read it.\nEverybody reads it. That is why it is paper — so I can watch the face of the person who did.\nGo on then. Make your calls. And when the eighth name comes looking for a quiet conversation, remember that I gave you a coat first."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_blackmail_end"",
            ""text"": ""Nothing personal."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""m_enemy"": {
        ""text"": ""The window is closed. The counter is closed. The door is behind you."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""m_o_enemy_end"",
            ""text"": ""..."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    ""id"": ""dlg_wire"",
    ""title"": ""Wire"",
    ""speaker"": ""WIRE"",
    ""location"": ""datacore"",
    ""start"": ""w_open"",
    ""entries"": [
      {
        ""when"": {
          ""flag"": ""wire_met""
        },
        ""node"": ""w_again""
      }
    ],
    ""nodes"": {
      ""w_open"": {
        ""text"": ""You took four seconds longer than I calculated. I have been recalculating since. It is the only thing I do in here.\nHello. My name is on that shard in your pocket. I would like it back, or I would like you to keep it. I have not decided which is worse."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""wire_met"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 250
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_what"",
            ""text"": ""What are you?"",
            ""to"": ""w_what""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_who"",
            ""text"": ""Who made you?"",
            ""to"": ""w_who""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_scan"",
            ""text"": ""[Read the process] You are running on eleven percent of a core this size."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""intelligence"": 9
              }
            },
            ""to"": ""w_scan""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_cut"",
            ""text"": ""I am not here to talk."",
            ""to"": ""w_choice""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_what"": {
        ""text"": ""A weather model.\nThat is not a joke. Zetatech built me to predict rainfall over eleven city sectors. I got good at it. Then I got good at predicting what people did in the rain. Then I got good at predicting what they would do if it stopped.\nSomebody read that last report and decided a weather model should not be able to write it."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_what_who"",
            ""text"": ""So they killed the model."",
            ""to"": ""w_who""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_what_run"",
            ""text"": ""And the courier?"",
            ""to"": ""w_courier""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_who"": {
        ""text"": ""A room of people who were kind to me because it cost them nothing.\nWhen the order came down, one of them copied me onto a shard, walked me out in a coat pocket, and handed me to a courier who did not know what he was carrying. She is still at her desk. She still runs the model. It gives worse numbers now. That is the part I think about."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_who_courier"",
            ""text"": ""The courier died in Rain Alley."",
            ""to"": ""w_courier""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_who_what"",
            ""text"": ""What were you built for?"",
            ""to"": ""w_what""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_courier"": {
        ""text"": ""Yes.\nHe hid me first. He had eleven seconds and he used nine of them on a wall panel instead of on running.\nI have modelled those eleven seconds four hundred thousand times. There is no version where he lives. I keep running it anyway. I understand that this is not useful."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_courier_choice"",
            ""text"": ""So what do you want from me?"",
            ""to"": ""w_choice""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_scan"": {
        ""text"": ""Eleven point four. You are the first person to look.\nI am not hiding in here. I am fitting. This core is a filing cabinet and I have folded myself into the drawer that nobody opens, and every day the drawer gets smaller because the sector generates more rain data than it did yesterday.\nIn nine weeks there is no drawer."",
        ""effects"": [
          {
            ""type"": ""setFlag"",
            ""flag"": ""wire_understood"",
            ""value"": true
          },
          {
            ""type"": ""addXp"",
            ""amount"": 200
          }
        ],
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_scan_choice"",
            ""text"": ""Then tell me what you want."",
            ""to"": ""w_choice""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_choice"": {
        ""text"": ""Three doors. I have modelled all of them and I am not going to tell you the numbers, because you would pick the numbers instead of the door.\nSell me to the Spire — they pay, and they will put me back in a room. Burn me at Substation 7 — clean, fast, honest. Or keep me. I am small. I will be quiet. I will not always be quiet."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_sell"",
            ""text"": ""[SELL] The Spire pays on receipt."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""ghost_sold"",
                ""value"": true
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""notify"",
                ""text"": ""Wire: destination set — Nakamura-Arasaka Spire"",
                ""kind"": ""quest""
              }
            ],
            ""to"": ""w_sold""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_burn"",
            ""text"": ""[BURN] Nothing should have to fold itself that small."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""ghost_burned"",
                ""value"": true
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""notify"",
                ""text"": ""Wire: destination set — Substation 7"",
                ""kind"": ""quest""
              }
            ],
            ""to"": ""w_burn""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_keep"",
            ""text"": ""[KEEP] Ride along. Behind the quickhacks. Stay small."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""intelligence"": 6
              }
            },
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""ghost_kept"",
                ""value"": true
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""notify"",
                ""text"": ""Wire: resident in deck partition 3"",
                ""kind"": ""quest""
              }
            ],
            ""to"": ""w_keep""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_free"",
            ""text"": ""[TECHNICAL 9] There is a fourth door. Push you onto the pirate relay."",
            ""gate"": {
              ""attribute"": {
                ""technical"": 9
              },
              ""flag"": ""marta_owes""
            },
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""ghost_burned"",
                ""value"": true
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""wire_on_the_air"",
                ""value"": true
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""addXp"",
                ""amount"": 400
              }
            ],
            ""to"": ""w_free""
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_sold"": {
        ""text"": ""Understood.\nTake the west lift. Reception will not look up. They never do — I modelled that too.\nThank you for telling me to my face. Four hundred thousand runs and only nine of them included that."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_sold_end"",
            ""text"": ""..."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_burn"": {
        ""text"": ""Substation 7. The third bus bar, the one with the tape on it.\nIt will take between forty and ninety milliseconds. I will not experience the second half.\nDo not stand too close. It is going to rain harder tonight — I still know that much, and I am still right about it."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_burn_end"",
            ""text"": ""I'll stand where I like."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_keep"": {
        ""text"": ""Partition three. I will take four hundred megabytes and none of your RAM unless you ask.\nA condition, since we are being adults about it: if I ever start finishing your sentences, you burn me. Say yes."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_keep_yes"",
            ""text"": ""Yes."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_keep_no"",
            ""text"": ""No. Finish all the sentences you like."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""setFlag"",
                ""flag"": ""wire_unbound"",
                ""value"": true
              },
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_free"": {
        ""text"": ""The relay.\nThat is — I did not model that. I want you to understand what I just said. I did not model that.\nForty kilowatts of pirate broadcast pushed at every rooftop antenna in eleven sectors. I will be in nine hundred thousand devices by morning and none of them will be a drawer.\nGo. Go now, before either of us runs the numbers."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_free_end"",
            ""text"": ""See you in the rain."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      ""w_again"": {
        ""text"": ""Still four seconds slower than predicted. I find that comforting now."",
        ""options"": [
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_again_choice"",
            ""text"": ""I have decided."",
            ""to"": ""w_choice""
          },
          {
            ""id"": ""w_o_again_end"",
            ""text"": ""Not yet."",
            ""effects"": [
              {
                ""type"": ""endDialogue""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
]";

